"""NEW ignored finite system-image evidence inquiry owner, SOURCE ONLY until review.

No arbitrary dispatch, credentials, GUI, input, pipe client or lifecycle action.
The generic POSIX durable owner is the sole launch authority for the complete
canonical guarded controller. The public Windows counter API is unchanged.
"""
